Adapted, not copied. The doctrine files in this directory are condensed and
rewritten from skills/refero-design/references/*.md in refero_skill:
shortened to a character budget, stripped of references to the upstream's own
tooling and research corpus, and written to prescribe no palette at all, because
the output lands in the user's project rather than in ours. Concrete hex values
appear only as values to avoid. LICENSE.refero_skill is refero_skill's MIT
licence, reproduced verbatim; it does not license this directory, it travels
with the material adapted from that project. OpenDesign is Apache-2.0, the same
licence as this repository, so its terms are already in LICENSE at the root.
